Installs FreeBSD on RK3588 systems that boot through U-Boot.

The installer requires the RK3588 U-Boot boot-storage property, selects a
target eMMC, SD, SATA, NVMe, or USB disk while excluding the live root disk,
optionally writes U-Boot only to MMC targets, reserves a GPT partition for
Rockchip firmware, and creates EFI and UFS or ZFS partitions.  It then runs the
standard FreeBSD configuration tools and installs the board DTB and U-Boot
menu.  A bundled pkg package bootstraps local packages without network access.
